    "en": [
     "The voice was reading its instructions out loud.",
     "I said no.",
     "Nothing was published.",
     "New rule: I approve every topic before production.",
     "And a real problem showed up.",
     "For sports, movies or celebrities, there is almost no copyright-free footage.",
     "So we changed course.",
     "The channel is now called Brief A I.",
     "And it covers what it knows best: artificial intelligence."
